<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Wells Fargo cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Wells Fargo cut to neutral.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns lowered its recommendation on Wells Fargo and Co to neutral from buy, according to market sources.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1-5/8 to 259 in early New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
